{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20004","headline":"立德新居 九 · 孟郊","name":"立德新居 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉蹄裂鸣水，金绶忽照门。\n拂拭贫士席，拜候丞相辕。\n德疎未爲高，礼至方觉尊。\n岂唯耀兹日，可以荣远孙。\n如何一阳朝，独荷衆瑞繁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}